    "body": "Hello,\n\nHappy to fill in the gaps, sorry the form came through so patchy.\n\nThe state is Colorado, CO. My first name is Grace. The house isn't in a trust, it's just in our names. For liability we'd like three hundred thousand. It has never sat empty, so zero months unoccupied. No pool, never wanted one. It's roughly 2,100 square feet, a single-story ranch. The roof is standing-seam metal, the long vertical panels. The breaker panel is a 200-amp service. The water heater is a tank, about six years old, down in the unfinished basement. The fire station is about a mile and a half from us and they're a career department, full-time firefighters. The nearest hydrant is maybe 150 feet down the street.\n\nOn the number of people in the home: that zero on the form must be a typo. There are two of us living here full time, my husband and me.\n\nThanks so much,\nGrace Ahn\n"
